---
import Slide from '../ui/Slide.astro';
import Callout from '../ui/Callout.astro';
---

<Slide
  id="s08b-reconciliation-stuck"
  chapter="Mindset"
  title="Where the Loop Gets Stuck"
  notes="Three common stall points. Diff = status never updates. Act = admission/quota/RBAC. Loop = CrashLoop forever."
>
  <div class="stagger grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-deck-cyan/40 bg-deck-cyan/5 p-8">
      <div class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-deck-cyan">Stuck at Diff</div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-deck-text/90">
        Status never catches up — check kubelet, CRI, probes.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-deck-amber/40 bg-deck-amber/5 p-8">
      <div class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-deck-amber">Stuck at Act</div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-deck-text/90">
        Action rejected — RBAC, quota, or admission webhook.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-deck-rose/40 bg-deck-rose/5 p-8">
      <div class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-deck-rose">Stuck in Loop</div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-deck-text/90">
        CrashLoop — controller recreates; fix the exit cause.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Callout type="rule" class="mt-8">
    Find the stall. Don’t restart the pod hoping the loop heals itself.
  </Callout>
</Slide>
